abstract: "An open specification for a health record the person controls: readable folders paired with FHIR entries, source links on every fact, a person-held key hierarchy, jurisdiction-aware protected categories, AI governed under Earned Autonomy, and portable network objects for requests, receipts, and disclosure proofs."
keywords:
